{"hw":"μηδαμός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">μηδαμός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">μηδαμ-ός</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ή</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">όν</span>, for <span class=\"gk\">μηδὲ ἁμός</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">not even one</b>, i.e. <b class=\"lex-tr\">not any one, no one</b>, only in pl. <span class=\"gk\">μηδαμοί</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">none</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.143</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">144</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.91</span> </span>, etc.: for neut. pl. v. μηδαμά.</div></div>"}